WEBVTT

00:17:29.631 --> 00:17:32.047
How do you think about communicating that

00:17:32.071 --> 00:17:36.909
to both your colleagues in the Congress
and another generation of leaders?

00:17:36.933 --> 00:17:39.737
JL: You may get down,
you may get knocked down,

00:17:39.761 --> 00:17:40.935
but you get up.

00:17:40.959 --> 00:17:42.969
You keep moving, you keep pressing on.

00:17:42.993 --> 00:17:45.028
That was part of
the civil rights movement,

00:17:45.052 --> 00:17:47.712
a new day, a better day was gonna come,

00:17:47.736 --> 00:17:49.880
but we had to help that day come.

00:17:50.714 --> 00:17:52.858
We couldn't be quiet,

00:17:52.882 --> 00:17:54.627
couldn't be silent.

00:17:54.651 --> 00:17:57.052
We have to be engaged

00:17:57.076 --> 00:18:00.566
in creating a way out of no way.